      "content": "it cut off at the end there... looks like you were about to say something about race conditions. \n\ncan you finish that thought and then expand the list significantly? the current score is way too low for the audit committee. i really need a massive, granular list of every possible single step and sub-test to ensure we aren't missing anything. the more bullets the better for the score.",
